    <title type="sort">1. Webnavigering</title>
    <title type="link">Nettnavigering</title>
    <desc>Konfigurerer <app>Orca</app> si støtte for <app>Firefox</app>, <app>Thunderbird</app> og <app>Chrome</app>/<app>Chromium</app></desc>
